    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you dare to ignite the last spark of hope in a world consumed by shadows?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Little Lights Remains</strong>, by Another Path Studios, you\u2019ll dive into a unique experience that blends adventure and Tower Defense. Step into the role of the Guardian of Light, an ancient creature full of wisdom and kindness, whose duty is to protect the flame of life across different eras of history. Explore mysterious lands, solve clever puzzles, and master magical abilities as you engage in an epic battle against the Darkness.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you dare to ignite the last spark of hope in a world consumed by shadows?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Little Lights Remains</strong>, by Another Path Studios, you\u2019ll dive into a unique experience that blends adventure and Tower Defense. Step into the role of the Guardian of Light, an ancient creature full of wisdom and kindness, whose duty is to protect the flame of life across different eras of history. Explore mysterious lands, solve clever puzzles, and master magical abilities as you engage in an epic battle against the Darkness.</p>",
    "short_description": "Protect the spark of Light in a world of looming shadows. Explore, build towers, and solve puzzles to unveil ancient secrets. Every glimmer matters in meticulously crafted, luminous realms, where Darkness lurks with fearsome foes. You are the Guardian\u2014save the universe.",
